{
  "name": "變化自身Shape Self（漿人）",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/creatures/slimes/slime-movement-pseudopods-blue.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>使用一個動作，你可以重塑你的身體，長出一個頭，一或兩隻胳膊，一或兩條腿，以及臨時的手和腳，你也可以變回沒有肢體的一團漿。當你具有人類般的身形時，你能穿着和你體型相同的類人生物的衣服和護甲。</p><p>使用一個附贈動作，你能擠出一條僞足，該僞足至多6寸寬，10尺長，或是將僞足吸收回你的身體裏。作爲該附贈動作的一部分，你能用這條僞足操縱一個物件，打開或關閉一扇門或容器，或是撿起或放下一個微型物件。這條僞足不具有感知器官，不能用來攻擊，啓動魔法物品，或是舉起超過10磅重的物體。</p><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p>As an action, you can reshape your body to give yourself a head, one or two arms, one or two legs, and makeshift hands and feet, or you can revert to a limbless blob. While you have a humanlike shape, you can wear clothing and armor made for a Humanoid of your size.</p><p>As a bonus action, you can extrude a pseudopod that is up to 6 inches wide and 10 feet long or reabsorb it into your body. As part of the same bonus action, you can use this pseudopod to manipulate an object, open or close a door or container, or pick up or set down a Tiny object. The pseudopod contains no sensory organs and can't attack, activate magic items, or lift more than 10 pounds.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
